sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client App
    participant GW as FastAPI Middleware / Router
    participant Auth as Auth Dependency (token_required)
    participant Route as Endpoint Handler
    participant Svc as Business / AI Service
    participant DB as SQLAlchemy / PostgreSQL

    Client->>GW: HTTP Request (Method, Path, Bearer Token)
    GW->>Auth: Validate JWT Token
    alt Invalid / Expired Token
        Auth-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    else Valid Token
        Auth->>DB: Query User record by user_id
        DB-->>Auth: User Entity
        Auth-->>Route: Inject current_user & db session
    end

    Route->>Route: Validate Pydantic Request Schema
    alt Request Body Validation Fails
        Route-->>Client: 422 Unprocessable Entity
    end

    Route->>Svc: Invoke Domain Business Logic
    alt Requires AI Processing
        Svc->>Svc: Call Gemini / ML Engine / Image Services
    end
    Svc->>DB: Perform CRUD Transactions
    DB-->>Svc: Persisted Record / Dataset
    Svc-->>Route: Return Result Object
    Route-->>Client: 200 OK (Pydantic Response Schema)